{"title": "Fiendish Blessing", "pageid": 6690, "url": "https://bg3.wiki/wiki/Fiendish_Blessing", "categories": ["Passive features", "Pages using deprecated parameters"], "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\">\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-common\">\n<figure class=\"mw-default-size mw-halign-right\" typeof=\"mw:File/Frameless\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:Generic_Physical.webp\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/e/ed/Generic_Physical.webp/300px-Generic_Physical.webp, /w/images/e/ed/Generic_Physical.webp 1.5x\"><img src=\"/w/images/thumb/e/ed/Generic_Physical.webp/300px-Generic_Physical.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"300\" height=\"300\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/e/ed/Generic_Physical.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a><figcaption></figcaption></figure>\n<p><b>Fiendish Blessing</b> is a <a href=\"/wiki/Cambion\" title=\"Cambion\">Cambion</a> passive feature that grants them an increase to their <a href=\"/wiki/Armour_Class\" title=\"Armour Class\">Armour Class</a>.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Description\"> Description </span></h2>\n<p>Protected by the blood of their fiendish ancestors, cambions have a +2 bonus to their <a href=\"/wiki/Armour_Class\" title=\"Armour Class\">Armour Class</a>. \n</p>\n<div style=\"clear: both;\"></div>\n</div> \n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"How_to_learn\"> How to learn </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<p>Used by creatures:</p><ul style=\"list-style-type: none\"><li><a href=\"/wiki/Cambion\" title=\"Cambion\">Cambion</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Cambion_(Planar_Ally)\" title=\"Cambion (Planar Ally)\">Cambion (Planar Ally)</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Cirrus\" title=\"Cirrus\">Cirrus</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Feena\" title=\"Feena\">Feena</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Raphael\" title=\"Raphael\">Raphael</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Vengeful_Cambion\" title=\"Vengeful Cambion\">Vengeful Cambion</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Zhalk\" title=\"Zhalk\">Zhalk</a></li></ul>\n</div>    <div class=\"bg3wiki-preview-only\">\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Brief_preview\"> Brief preview </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">+2 to <a href=\"/wiki/AC\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"AC\">AC</a>.</div>\n</div>  \n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260714235741\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.027 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.031 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 474/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 1940/4194304 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 1227/4194304 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 10/200\nExpensive parser function count: 0/750\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 502/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 40/1000\nLua time usage: 0.003/7.000 seconds\nLua memory usage: 643666/52428800 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   27.484      1 Template:Passive_feature_page\n100.00%   27.484      1 -total\n 33.26%    9.140      1 Template:Main_namespace_only\n 25.17%    6.919      2 Template:Hidden_code\n 16.87%    4.637      1 Template:PageSeo\n 12.57%    3.456      1 Template:Passive_weapons_list\n 10.59%    2.910      1 Template:Page_style\n  9.30%    2.557      3 Template:IfEmpty\n  9.06%    2.490      1 Template:Passive_creatures_list\n  5.36%    1.474      1 Template:Passive_equipment_list\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key bg3wiki:pcache:idhash:6690-0!canonical and timestamp 20260714235741 and revision id 373471. Rendering was triggered because: unknown\n -->\n</div>"}